{"title": "Jaheira's Family", "pageid": 50430, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Jaheira's_Family", "categories": ["Harpers", "Factions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Elerrathins_Home.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Elerrathins_Home.jpg/300px-Elerrathins_Home.jpg.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Elerrathins_Home.jpg/450px-Elerrathins_Home.jpg.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Elerrathins_Home.jpg/600px-Elerrathins_Home.jpg.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Elerrathins_Home.jpg/300px-Elerrathins_Home.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"169\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5f/Elerrathins_Home.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption>Outside view of Elerrathin's Home</figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Harp-Shaped_Pin_Unfaded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/8/8a/Harp-Shaped_Pin_Unfaded.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"144\" height=\"144\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8a/Harp-Shaped_Pin_Unfaded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption>Engraved Harp-Shaped Pin</figcaption></figure>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jaheira\" title=\"Jaheira\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a8/Portrait_Jaheira.png/25px-Portrait_Jaheira.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a8/Portrait_Jaheira.png/38px-Portrait_Jaheira.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a8/Portrait_Jaheira.png/50px-Portrait_Jaheira.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Jaheira\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a8/Portrait_Jaheira.png/25px-Portrait_Jaheira.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a8/Portrait_Jaheira.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Jaheira\" title=\"Jaheira\">Jaheira</a> defines her family as consisting of herself, her wards, and several animals.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Overview\">Overview</span></h2>\n<p>The family home is a building called <a href=\"/wiki/Elerrathin%27s_Home\" title=\"Elerrathin's Home\">Elerrathin's Home</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City\" title=\"Lower City\">Lower City</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate\" title=\"Baldur's Gate\">Baldur's Gate</a>. The basement of the building is a small lush cavern where Jaheira keeps supplies and her personal effects, including several very rare items.\n</p><p>Attacking any of her children turns Jaheira and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Minsc\" title=\"Minsc\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Portrait_Minsc.png/25px-Portrait_Minsc.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Portrait_Minsc.png/38px-Portrait_Minsc.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Portrait_Minsc.png/50px-Portrait_Minsc.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Minsc\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Portrait_Minsc.png/25px-Portrait_Minsc.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d6/Portrait_Minsc.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Minsc\" title=\"Minsc\">Minsc</a> hostile. If neither of them are in the active party, they permanently leave after the player character talks to them.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Locations\">Locations</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elerrathin%27s_Home\" title=\"Elerrathin's Home\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/38px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/50px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Elerrathin's Home\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Elerrathin%27s_Home\" title=\"Elerrathin's Home\">Elerrathin's Home</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Items\">Items</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Engraved_Pin\" title=\"Engraved Pin\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/18/Harp-Shaped_Pin_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Harp-Shaped_Pin_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/18/Harp-Shaped_Pin_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Harp-Shaped_Pin_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/18/Harp-Shaped_Pin_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Harp-Shaped_Pin_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/18/Harp-Shaped_Pin_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Harp-Shaped_Pin_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/18/Harp-Shaped_Pin_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Engraved_Pin\" title=\"Engraved Pin\">Engraved Pin</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Harp-Shaped_Pin\" title=\"Harp-Shaped Pin\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/18/Harp-Shaped_Pin_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Harp-Shaped_Pin_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/18/Harp-Shaped_Pin_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Harp-Shaped_Pin_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/18/Harp-Shaped_Pin_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Harp-Shaped_Pin_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/18/Harp-Shaped_Pin_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Harp-Shaped_Pin_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/18/Harp-Shaped_Pin_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Harp-Shaped_Pin\" title=\"Harp-Shaped Pin\">Harp-Shaped Pin</a></span></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Family_members\">Family members</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Characters\">Characters</span></h3>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fig\" title=\"Fig\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0c/Portrait_Fig.png/25px-Portrait_Fig.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0c/Portrait_Fig.png/38px-Portrait_Fig.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0c/Portrait_Fig.png/50px-Portrait_Fig.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fig\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0c/Portrait_Fig.png/25px-Portrait_Fig.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0c/Portrait_Fig.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fig\" title=\"Fig\">Fig</a> - acts as the home's 'sentinel', stopping and questioning any new visitors. She spends her day on the porch, practicing swordsmanship against a dummy.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jaheira\" title=\"Jaheira\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a8/Portrait_Jaheira.png/30px-Portrait_Jaheira.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a8/Portrait_Jaheira.png/45px-Portrait_Jaheira.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a8/Portrait_Jaheira.png/60px-Portrait_Jaheira.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Jaheira\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a8/Portrait_Jaheira.png/30px-Portrait_Jaheira.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a8/Portrait_Jaheira.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Jaheira\" title=\"Jaheira\">Jaheira</a> - stepmother</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jhessem\" title=\"Jhessem\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/56/Portrait_Jhessem.png/25px-Portrait_Jhessem.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/56/Portrait_Jhessem.png/38px-Portrait_Jhessem.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/56/Portrait_Jhessem.png/50px-Portrait_Jhessem.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Jhessem\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/56/Portrait_Jhessem.png/25px-Portrait_Jhessem.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/56/Portrait_Jhessem.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Jhessem\" title=\"Jhessem\">Jhessem</a> - a small child<sup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> who speaks with the decorum of nobility. She has found a family tree of Jaheira's and dreams of becoming a queen of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Tethyr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Tethyr\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Tethyr\">Tethyr</a></span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jord\" title=\"Jord\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Portrait_Jord.png/25px-Portrait_Jord.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Portrait_Jord.png/38px-Portrait_Jord.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Portrait_Jord.png/50px-Portrait_Jord.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Jord\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Portrait_Jord.png/25px-Portrait_Jord.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cb/Portrait_Jord.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Jord\" title=\"Jord\">Jord</a> - a druid apprentice who watches over plants in the house. He can share a story of Jaheira defending him from a meddlesome merchant when he was nine years old.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rion\" title=\"Rion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Portrait_Rion.png/25px-Portrait_Rion.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a2/Portrait_Rion.png/38px-Portrait_Rion.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a2/Portrait_Rion.png/50px-Portrait_Rion.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Rion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Portrait_Rion.png/25px-Portrait_Rion.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a2/Portrait_Rion.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Rion\" title=\"Rion\">Rion</a> - an unspoken leader over other wards in Jaheira's absence. A former member of the <a href=\"/wiki/Flaming_Fist\" title=\"Flaming Fist\">Flaming Fist</a>, she occasionally makes moves to keep order in the neighbourhood.<sup id=\"cite_ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tate\" title=\"Tate\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/52/Portrait_Tate.png/25px-Portrait_Tate.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/52/Portrait_Tate.png/38px-Portrait_Tate.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/52/Portrait_Tate.png/50px-Portrait_Tate.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Tate\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/52/Portrait_Tate.png/25px-Portrait_Tate.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/52/Portrait_Tate.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Tate\" title=\"Tate\">Tate</a> - described by Jaheira as a <i>\"little sneak-thief\"</i>. He seems to be the latest one adopted, apparently having lost his parents to the <a href=\"/wiki/Cult_of_the_Absolute\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cult of the Absolute\">Cult of the Absolute</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> Tate is afraid of losing his new family as well, and prefers to remain upstairs, eavesdropping on conversations.</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Animals\">Animals</span></h3>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Messenger_Rat\" title=\"Messenger Rat\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Portrait_Messenger_Rat.png/30px-Portrait_Messenger_Rat.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Portrait_Messenger_Rat.png/45px-Portrait_Messenger_Rat.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Portrait_Messenger_Rat.png/60px-Portrait_Messenger_Rat.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Messenger Rat\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Portrait_Messenger_Rat.png/30px-Portrait_Messenger_Rat.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e9/Portrait_Messenger_Rat.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Messenger_Rat\" title=\"Messenger Rat\">Messenger Rat</a> - 4x</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Postmaster_Badger\" title=\"Postmaster Badger\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/16/Portrait_Postmaster_Badger.png/30px-Portrait_Postmaster_Badger.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/16/Portrait_Postmaster_Badger.png/45px-Portrait_Postmaster_Badger.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/16/Portrait_Postmaster_Badger.png/60px-Portrait_Postmaster_Badger.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Postmaster Badger\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/16/Portrait_Postmaster_Badger.png/30px-Portrait_Postmaster_Badger.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/16/Portrait_Postmaster_Badger.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Postmaster_Badger\" title=\"Postmaster Badger\">Postmaster Badger</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes_and_references\">Notes and references</span></h2>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r345964\">.mw-parser-output .reflist .references{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .refs-act1::before{content:\"Act 1\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-act2::before{content:\"Act 2\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-act3::before{content:\"Act 3\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-style:italic;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-url::before{content:\"External links\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-text::before{content:\"Literature\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-note::before{content:\"Notes\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}</style><div class=\"reflist refs-nogroup\" style=\"list-style-type:decimal;\"><div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> Precise ages are not known. The character UIDs give the relative ages within each gender (Jord &gt; Tate, and Rion &gt; Jhessem &gt; Fig), and it is clear that Jord is older than Jhessm or Fig </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-2\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> As stated in <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Final_Warning_(Elerrathin%27s_Home)\" title=\"Final Warning (Elerrathin's Home)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/71/Book_Parchment_B_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Parchment_B_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/71/Book_Parchment_B_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Parchment_B_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/71/Book_Parchment_B_Item_Icon.png/40px-Book_Parchment_B_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/71/Book_Parchment_B_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Parchment_B_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/71/Book_Parchment_B_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Final_Warning_(Elerrathin%27s_Home)\" title=\"Final Warning (Elerrathin's Home)\">Final Warning</a> letter, found in the garden room. </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-3\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-3\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> As stated in <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Harper_Report:_No_Leads\" title=\"Harper Report: No Leads\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Book_Note_N_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Note_N_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Book_Note_N_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Note_N_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Book_Note_N_Item_Icon.png/40px-Book_Note_N_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Book_Note_N_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Note_N_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\